<title>POLAND: Poland to offer up to 36 pct KGHM from June 30.</title>
<headline>Poland to offer up to 36 pct KGHM from June 30.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will offer up to 72 million out of a total of 200 million shares or 36 percent of its copper concern KGHM Polska Miedz SA in a public offering starting on June 30, the Polish Securities Commission said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
</text>
